#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:2
msgid "Controllers"
msgstr "控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:6
msgid ""
"Controllers turn desired motion or contact forces into joint commands. "
"Joint-space controllers act on individual joints; task-space controllers act"
" on an end effector."
msgstr "控制器将期望运动或接触力转换为关节命令。关节空间控制器作用于各个关节，任务空间控制器则作用于末端执行器。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:9
msgid ""
"Contact tasks often need compliance to tolerate errors in the robot or "
"environment model :cite:p:`siciliano2009force`. Two common approaches are:"
msgstr "接触任务通常需要一定的柔顺性，以容忍机器人或环境模型的误差 :cite:p:`siciliano2009force`。常见方法有两种："

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Impedance control:** Relates motion error to contact force through a mass-"
"spring-damper model. Stiffness control uses only the static relationship "
"between position error and force."
msgstr "**阻抗控制：** 通过质量—弹簧—阻尼模型建立运动误差与接触力的关系。刚度控制仅使用位置误差与力之间的静态关系。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Hybrid force/motion control:** Controls motion along free directions and "
"force along constrained directions. Isaac Lab's implementation uses "
"operational-space inverse dynamics :cite:p:`khatib1987osc`."
msgstr ""
"**力/运动混合控制：** 在自由方向控制运动，在受约束方向控制力。Isaac Lab 的实现采用操作空间逆动力学 "
":cite:p:`khatib1987osc`。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:21
msgid "Choosing a controller"
msgstr "选择控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:23
msgid ""
"The core controllers below live in ``isaaclab.controllers``. Isaac Lab also "
"provides :ref:`Newton controllers <newton-controllers>` with additional "
"control options and an iterative IK solver."
msgstr ""
"下述核心控制器位于 ``isaaclab.controllers``。Isaac Lab 还提供 :ref:`Newton 控制器 <newton-"
"controllers>`，包含更多控制选项和迭代 IK 求解器。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:31
msgid "Controller"
msgstr "控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:32
msgid "Input command"
msgstr "输入指令"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:33
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:34
msgid "Required state"
msgstr "所需状态"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:35
msgid ":class:`DifferentialIKController`"
msgstr ":class:`DifferentialIKController`"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:36
msgid "End-effector position or pose, absolute or relative"
msgstr "末端执行器的位置或位姿，可使用绝对值或相对增量"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:37
msgid "Joint position targets"
msgstr "关节位置目标"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:38
msgid "Joint positions, end-effector pose, and Jacobian in a consistent frame"
msgstr "关节位置，以及在同一坐标系下表示的末端执行器位姿和雅可比矩阵"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:39
msgid ":class:`OperationalSpaceController`"
msgstr ":class:`OperationalSpaceController`"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:40
msgid ""
"End-effector pose and/or wrench, optionally stiffness and damping ratios"
msgstr "末端执行器位姿和/或力旋量，也可包含刚度和阻尼比"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:41
msgid "Joint efforts"
msgstr "关节力/力矩"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:42
msgid ""
"Jacobian; pose and velocity for motion control; mass matrix for inertial "
"decoupling; gravity vector, contact force, and joint state as required by "
"enabled features"
msgstr "雅可比矩阵；运动控制所需的位姿和速度；惯性解耦所需的质量矩阵；以及根据启用功能提供的重力向量、接触力和关节状态"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:45
msgid ""
"Basic joint-space control sets joint targets directly on the actuators. For "
"joint-space impedance control, use :class:`JointImpedanceController` (see "
"`Joint-space controllers`_)."
msgstr ""
"基本的关节空间控制直接向执行器设置关节目标。关节空间阻抗控制可使用 :class:`JointImpedanceController` ，见 "
"`关节空间控制器 <Joint-space controllers_>`_。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:49
msgid ""
"Start with differential IK for reaching or teleoperation with position-"
"controlled actuators. Choose OSC when you need torque commands, task-space "
"compliance, or simultaneous motion and contact force control. For example, "
"wiping a table requires motion along its surface while maintaining a force "
"normal to it."
msgstr ""
"使用位置控制执行器进行到达目标或遥操作时，可以先选用微分 IK。需要输出力矩指令、实现任务空间柔顺性，或同时控制运动和接触力时，可选用 "
"OSC。例如，擦拭桌面时，需要沿桌面运动，同时维持沿桌面法向的接触力。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:54
msgid ""
"The :doc:`IK walkthrough <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` and :doc:`OSC walkthrough "
"<../how-to/run_osc>` provide complete scenes, state extraction, and runnable"
" demonstrations. Both tutorial scripts use Isaac Sim PhysX and require an "
"Isaac Sim installation."
msgstr ""
":doc:`IK 教程 <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` 和 :doc:`OSC 教程 <../how-to/run_osc>` "
"提供了完整场景、状态提取方法和可运行的演示。两个教程脚本均使用 Isaac Sim PhysX，需要安装 Isaac Sim。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:64
msgid ""
"Franka arms on stands with coordinate-frame markers at their end effectors."
msgstr "安装在支架上的 Franka 机械臂，末端执行器处显示坐标系标记。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:67
msgid ""
"**IK: reach a pose.** Each arm tracks an end-effector goal through joint "
"position targets. :doc:`Run the IK demonstration <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` to"
" watch the measured and desired frame markers converge."
msgstr ""
"**IK：到达目标位姿。** 每条机械臂通过关节位置目标跟踪末端执行器的目标位姿。运行 :doc:`IK 演示 <../how-"
"to/run_diff_ik>` ，可以观察实际位姿与目标位姿的坐标系标记逐渐重合。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:73
msgid ""
"Franka arms touching translucent red tilted walls with their fingertips."
msgstr "Franka 机械臂用指尖接触半透明的红色倾斜墙面。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:76
msgid ""
"**OSC: control motion and contact force.** The tilted-wall example commands "
"10 N along the wall normal while tracking pose in the other directions. "
":doc:`Run the OSC demonstration <../how-to/run_osc>`."
msgstr ""
"**OSC：控制运动和接触力。** 倾斜墙面示例沿墙面法向施加 10 N 的目标力，同时在其他方向上跟踪目标位姿。详见 :doc:`OSC 演示 "
"<../how-to/run_osc>` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:83
msgid "Newton controllers"
msgstr "Newton 控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:85
msgid ""
"``isaaclab_newton.controllers`` wraps Newton's batched controllers for use "
"with PyTorch tensors. These three controllers work with any physics backend:"
" the caller supplies the robot state, Jacobian, and dynamics required by the"
" enabled features. They do not require a Newton simulation model."
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab_newton.controllers`` 将 Newton 的批量控制器封装为可使用 PyTorch "
"张量的接口。以下三个控制器均适用于任意物理后端：调用者根据所启用的功能，提供机器人状态、雅可比矩阵和动力学信息，无需 Newton 仿真模型。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:90
msgid ""
"**Differential IK** — "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonDifferentialIKController` "
"produces joint position targets from an end-effector goal. It supports axis "
"weighting, adaptive damping, truncated SVD, joint-limit avoidance, and null-"
"space posture control. Configure it with "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonDifferentialIKControllerCfg`."
msgstr ""
"**微分 IK** — "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonDifferentialIKController` "
"根据末端目标生成关节位置目标，支持轴向权重、自适应阻尼、截断 SVD、关节限位规避和零空间姿态控制。使用 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonDifferentialIKControllerCfg` 配置。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:96
msgid ""
"**Joint impedance** — "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonJointImpedanceController` "
"produces joint efforts from desired joint positions and velocities. Options "
"include inertia decoupling, gravity and Coriolis compensation, acceleration "
"feedforward, and gains that can change each control step. Configure it with "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonJointImpedanceControllerCfg`."
msgstr ""
"**关节阻抗控制** — "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonJointImpedanceController` "
"根据期望关节位置和速度生成关节力/力矩，支持惯性解耦、重力与科里奥利力补偿、加速度前馈，以及逐控制步更新增益。使用 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonJointImpedanceControllerCfg` 配置。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:102
msgid ""
"**Operational-space control** — "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonOperationalSpaceController` "
"produces joint efforts for task-space motion and wrench control. It supports"
" desired end-effector velocity, separate linear and angular selection "
"frames, and null-space posture control. Configure it with "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonOperationalSpaceControllerCfg`."
msgstr ""
"**操作空间控制** — "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonOperationalSpaceController` "
"为任务空间运动和力/力矩控制生成关节力/力矩，支持期望末端速度、分别选择线运动和角运动的坐标系，以及零空间姿态控制。使用 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.NewtonOperationalSpaceControllerCfg` "
"配置。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:109
msgid ""
"In a direct environment, create the controller once, pass current state and "
"targets to ``compute()`` each control step, and apply the returned joint "
"targets or efforts through ``articulation.actuators``. These wrappers have "
"their own configurations and ``compute()`` arguments; they do not use the "
"core controllers' ``set_command()`` API. They compute in float32, and "
"contiguous float32 inputs can be shared without copies. Returned tensors "
"reference reusable output buffers, so clone them if you need to keep a "
"result after the next call."
msgstr ""
"在直接工作流环境中，创建一次控制器，然后在每个控制步向 ``compute()`` 传入当前状态和目标，并通过 "
"``articulation.actuators`` 施加返回的关节目标或力/力矩。这些封装具有各自的配置和 ``compute()`` "
"参数，不使用核心控制器的 ``set_command()`` API。计算使用 float32，连续的 float32 "
"输入可以零拷贝共享。返回张量引用可复用的输出缓冲区；若需在下一次调用后保留结果，请先克隆。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:117
msgid ""
"For manager-based tasks, use "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.envs.mdp.NewtonDifferentialInverseKinematicsActionCfg`"
" or "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.envs.mdp.NewtonOperationalSpaceControllerActionCfg`"
" to connect the corresponding controller to the robot. For example, this "
"action commands an absolute Franka hand position in the robot's root frame:"
msgstr ""
"对于基于管理器的任务，使用 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.envs.mdp.NewtonDifferentialInverseKinematicsActionCfg`"
" 或 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.envs.mdp.NewtonOperationalSpaceControllerActionCfg`"
" 将相应控制器连接到机器人。例如，以下动作在机器人根坐标系中指定 Franka 手部的绝对位置："

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:140
msgid ""
"Add this term to the task's actions configuration and match the asset, "
"joint, and body names to your robot. Use position-controlled actuators for "
"differential IK; use effort control for operational-space control."
msgstr "将该项加入任务的动作配置，并使资产、关节和刚体名称与机器人匹配。微分 IK 应使用位置控制执行器，操作空间控制应使用力/力矩控制。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:145
msgid "Iterative IK with Newton"
msgstr "使用 Newton 进行迭代 IK 求解"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:147
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.ik.NewtonIKSolver` solves pose "
"objectives iteratively using a Newton model, rather than taking a "
"differential IK step from a supplied Jacobian. Combine "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.ik.NewtonIKPoseObjectiveCfg` objectives"
" for one or more bodies with "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.ik.NewtonIKJointLimitObjectiveCfg` to "
"penalize joint-limit violations. "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.ik.NewtonIKSolverCfg` selects LM or "
"L-BFGS optimization, the Jacobian method, seed sampling, and iteration "
"count."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.ik.NewtonIKSolver` 基于 Newton "
"模型迭代求解位姿目标，而不是利用传入的雅可比矩阵进行单步微分 IK。可以将一个或多个刚体的 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.ik.NewtonIKPoseObjectiveCfg` 目标与 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.ik.NewtonIKJointLimitObjectiveCfg` "
"组合，以惩罚关节限位违反量。:class:`~isaaclab_newton.controllers.ik.NewtonIKSolverCfg` "
"用于选择 LM 或 L-BFGS 优化、雅可比计算方法、种子采样方式和迭代次数。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:157
msgid ""
"Use :class:`~isaaclab_newton.envs.mdp.NewtonInverseKinematicsActionCfg` to "
"drive this solver from a manager-based task. This action currently requires "
"a fixed-base articulation with a registered Newton prototype model; its "
"joints and target bodies must resolve in both Isaac Lab and that model."
msgstr ""
"使用 :class:`~isaaclab_newton.envs.mdp.NewtonInverseKinematicsActionCfg` "
"可在基于管理器的任务中调用此求解器。目前该动作要求固定基座的关节系统，并已注册 Newton 原型模型；关节和目标刚体必须在 Isaac Lab "
"与该模型中都能解析。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:162
msgid ""
"See :doc:`/source/api/lab_newton/isaaclab_newton.controllers` for the full "
"controller, solver, and configuration APIs."
msgstr ""
"完整的控制器、求解器和配置 API 见 "
":doc:`/source/api/lab_newton/isaaclab_newton.controllers`。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:169
msgid "The control loop"
msgstr "控制循环"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:171
msgid ""
"The IK and OSC instances compute targets from state supplied by the caller; "
"they do not read the simulation or submit actuator commands. "
":meth:`~DifferentialIKController.set_command` stores a goal until it is "
"replaced, and every control cycle reads fresh state, calls ``compute()``, "
"stages the targets, and steps the simulation; see :ref:`controller-api-"
"examples` for the loop from the IK walkthrough. IK targets are joint "
"positions that the configured position actuator tracks. OSC targets are "
"joint efforts, so configure zero actuator stiffness and damping to keep "
"actuator feedback from adding to them."
msgstr ""
"IK 和 OSC "
"控制器根据调用者提供的状态计算目标值，不会自行读取仿真状态或向执行器发送指令。:meth:`~DifferentialIKController.set_command`"
" 保存目标，直到下一次设置将其替换。每个控制周期都需要读取最新状态、调用 ``compute()``、写入目标，再推进仿真；IK 教程中的循环见 "
":ref:`controller-api-examples` 。IK 输出关节位置目标，由配置的位置执行器跟踪。OSC "
"输出关节力/力矩目标，因此应将执行器刚度和阻尼设为零，避免执行器的反馈控制额外叠加力/力矩。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:180
msgid ""
"Keep the command, end-effector pose, and Jacobian in a consistent coordinate"
" frame. The tutorials use the suffix ``_b`` for the robot base frame and "
"``_w`` for the world frame; these names do not transform the data. Absolute "
"poses contain position followed by a quaternion in ``(x, y, z, w)`` order. "
"For OSC, commands and axis selections can use a separate task frame, while "
"state passed to ``compute()`` remains in the base frame."
msgstr ""
"指令、末端执行器位姿和雅可比矩阵必须使用一致的坐标系。教程用后缀 ``_b`` 表示机器人基座坐标系，用 ``_w`` "
"表示世界坐标系；变量名称本身不会变换数据。绝对位姿由位置和四元数组成，四元数采用 ``(x, y, z, w)`` 顺序。OSC "
"的指令和控制轴选择可以使用单独的任务坐标系，但传入 ``compute()`` 的状态仍须在基座坐标系下表示。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:188
msgid "Joint-space controllers"
msgstr "关节空间控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:190
msgid ""
"There is no dedicated configuration class for selecting a joint-space "
"control mode. Instead, the control mode follows from which targets you set "
"through ``articulation.actuators``: effort targets for torque control, "
"velocity targets for velocity control, and position targets for position "
"control. See :ref:`actuators-runtime-api` for the runtime API."
msgstr ""
"没有专门用于选择关节空间控制模式的配置类。控制模式取决于通过 ``articulation.actuators`` "
"设置哪些目标：驱动力目标对应力矩控制，速度目标对应速度控制，位置目标对应位置控制。运行时 API 见 :ref:`actuators-runtime-"
"api` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:196
msgid "Torque control"
msgstr "力矩控制"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:198
#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:211
#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:231
msgid "Action dimensions: ``\"n\"`` (number of joints)"
msgstr "动作维度: ``\"n\"`` （关节数量）"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:200
msgid ""
"In torque control mode, the input actions are directly set as feed-forward "
"joint torque commands, i.e. at every time-step,"
msgstr "在扭矩控制模式下，输入动作被直接设置为前馈关节扭矩命令，即在每个时间步，"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:203
msgid "\\tau = \\tau_{des}"
msgstr "\\tau = \\tau_{des}"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:209
msgid "Velocity control"
msgstr "速度控制"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:213
msgid ""
"In velocity control mode, a proportional control law is required to reduce "
"the error between the current and desired joint velocities. Based on input "
"actions, the joint torques commands are computed as:"
msgstr "在速度控制模式下，需要一个比例控制律来减少当前与期望关节速度之间的误差。基于输入动作，关节扭矩命令计算如下:"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:216
msgid "\\tau = k_d (\\dot{q}_{des} - \\dot{q})"
msgstr "\\tau = k_d (\\dot{q}_{des} - \\dot{q})"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:220
msgid "where :math:`k_d` are the gains parsed from configuration."
msgstr "在这里 :math:`k_d` 是从配置中解析得到的增益。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:224
msgid ""
"While performing velocity control, in many cases, gravity compensation is "
"required to ensure better tracking of the command. In this case, we suggest "
"disabling gravity for the links in the articulation in simulation."
msgstr "在执行速度控制时，在许多情况下，需要进行重力补偿以确保更好地跟踪命令。在这种情况下，我们建议在仿真中禁用关节中链节的重力。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:229
msgid "Position control with fixed impedance"
msgstr "位置控制与固定阻抗"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:233
msgid ""
"Position control uses a proportional-derivative (PD) law to track joint "
"positions with zero target velocity:"
msgstr "位置控制采用比例—微分（PD）控制律，在目标速度为零的条件下跟踪关节位置："

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:236
msgid "\\tau = k_p (q_{des} - q)  - k_d \\dot{q}"
msgstr "\\tau = k_p (q_{des} - q)  - k_d \\dot{q}"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:240
msgid ""
"where :math:`k_p` and :math:`k_d` are the gains parsed from configuration."
msgstr "其中 :math:`k_p` 和 :math:`k_d` 是从配置中解析出的增益。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:242
msgid ""
"A more complete formulation which considers the dynamics of the articulation"
" would be:"
msgstr "考虑关节体动力学后，更完整的表达式为："

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:244
msgid "\\tau = M \\left( k_p (q_{des} - q)  - k_d \\dot{q} \\right) + g"
msgstr "\\tau = M \\left( k_p (q_{des} - q)  - k_d \\dot{q} \\right) + g"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:248
msgid ""
"where :math:`M` is the joint-space inertia matrix of size :math:`n \\times "
"n`, and :math:`g` is the joint-space gravity vector. This implementation is "
"available through the :class:`JointImpedanceController` class by setting the"
" impedance mode to ``\"fixed\"``. The gains :math:`k_p` are parsed from the "
"input configuration and :math:`k_d` are computed while considering the "
"system as a decoupled point-mass oscillator, i.e.,"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`M` 是大小为 :math:`n \\times n` 的关节空间惯性矩阵， :math:`g` "
"是关节空间重力向量。通过将阻抗模式设置为 ``\"fixed\"`` ，可以通过 :class:`JointImpedanceController` "
"类来实现此功能。增益 :math:`k_p` 从输入配置中解析， :math:`k_d` 则在将系统视为解耦的点质量振荡器时计算得出，即，"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:253
msgid "k_d = 2 \\sqrt{k_p} \\times D"
msgstr "k_d = 2 \\sqrt{k_p} \\times D"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:257
msgid ""
"where :math:`D` is the damping ratio of the system. Critical damping is "
"achieved for :math:`D = 1`, overcritical damping for :math:`D > 1` and "
"undercritical damping for :math:`D < 1`."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`D` 是系统的阻尼比。当 :math:`D = 1` 时，系统达到临界阻尼；当 :math:`D > 1` 时，系统为过阻尼；当 "
":math:`D < 1` 时，系统为欠阻尼。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:260
msgid ""
"Additionally, it is possible to disable the inertial or gravity compensation"
" in the controller by setting the flags :attr:`inertial_compensation` and  "
":attr:`gravity_compensation` in the configuration to :obj:`False`, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"此外，可以通过将配置中的标志 :attr:`inertial_compensation` 和 :attr:`gravity_compensation` "
"分别设置为 :obj:`False` 来禁用控制器中的惯性补偿或重力补偿。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:265
msgid "Position control with variable stiffness"
msgstr "位置控制与可变刚度"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:267
msgid "Action dimensions: ``\"2n\"`` (number of joints)"
msgstr "动作维度: ``\"2n\"`` （关节数）"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:269
msgid ""
"Variable-stiffness control uses the same law, with :math:`k_p` supplied in "
"the command. Set :class:`JointImpedanceController` to ``\"variable_kp\"`` "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"可变刚度控制使用相同的控制律，但由命令提供 :math:`k_p`。将 :class:`JointImpedanceController` 设为 "
"``\"variable_kp\"`` 模式即可。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:273
msgid "Position control with variable impedance"
msgstr "位置控制与可变阻抗"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:275
msgid "Action dimensions: ``\"3n\"`` (number of joints)"
msgstr "动作维度: ``\"3n\"`` （关节数）"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:277
msgid ""
"Variable-impedance control also supplies damping through the command. Set "
":class:`JointImpedanceController` to ``\"variable\"`` mode."
msgstr ""
"可变阻抗控制还通过命令提供阻尼。将 :class:`JointImpedanceController` 设为 ``\"variable\"`` "
"模式即可。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:281
msgid "Task-space controllers"
msgstr "任务空间控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:284
msgid "Differential inverse kinematics (IK)"
msgstr "微分逆运动学 (IK)"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:286
msgid ""
"Action dimensions:  ``\"3\"`` (relative/absolute position), ``\"6\"`` "
"(relative pose), or ``\"7\"`` (absolute pose)"
msgstr "动作维度: ``\"3\"`` （相对/绝对位置）， ``\"6\"`` （相对姿态），或 ``\"7\"`` （绝对姿态）"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:288
msgid ""
"Inverse kinematics converts the task-space tracking error to joint-space "
"error. In its most typical implementation, the pose error in the task-space,"
" :math:`\\Delta \\chi_e = (\\Delta p_e, \\Delta \\phi_e)`, is computed as "
"the Cartesian distance between the desired and current task-space positions,"
" and the shortest distance in :math:`\\mathbb{SO}(3)` between the desired "
"and current task-space orientations."
msgstr ""
"逆运动学将任务空间中的跟踪误差转换为关节空间误差。最常见的实现先计算任务空间位姿误差 :math:`\\Delta \\chi_e = (\\Delta"
" p_e, \\Delta \\phi_e)` ：位置误差为目标位置与当前位置之间的笛卡尔距离，姿态误差为目标姿态与当前姿态在 "
":math:`\\mathbb{SO}(3)` 中的最短距离。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:293
msgid ""
"Using the geometric Jacobian :math:`J_{eO} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{6 \\times n}`, "
"that relates task-space velocity to joint-space velocities, we design the "
"control law to obtain the desired joint positions as:"
msgstr ""
"使用几何雅可比矩阵 :math:`J_{eO} \\in \\mathbb{R}^{6 \\times n}` "
"，它将任务空间的速度与关节空间的速度关联起来，我们设计控制律以获得期望的关节位置，如下所示:"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:296
msgid "q_{des} = q + \\eta J_{eO}^{-} \\Delta \\chi_e"
msgstr "q_{des} = q + \\eta J_{eO}^{-} \\Delta \\chi_e"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:300
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\eta` is a scaling parameter and :math:`J_{eO}^{-}` is the "
"pseudo-inverse of the Jacobian."
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\eta` 是一个缩放参数，而 :math:`J_{eO}^{-}` 是雅可比矩阵的伪逆。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:302
msgid ""
"It is possible to compute the pseudo-inverse of the Jacobian using different"
" formulations:"
msgstr "可以使用不同的公式计算雅可比矩阵的伪逆:"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:304
msgid ""
"Moore-Penrose pseudo-inverse (``\"pinv\"``): :math:`A^{-} = A^T(AA^T)^{-1}`."
msgstr "Moore–Penrose 伪逆（``\"pinv\"``）：:math:`A^{-} = A^T(AA^T)^{-1}` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:305
msgid ""
"Levenberg-Marquardt pseudo-inverse (damped least-squares, ``\"dls\"``): "
":math:`A^{-} = A^T (AA^T + \\lambda^2 \\mathbb{I})^{-1}`."
msgstr ""
"Levenberg–Marquardt 伪逆（阻尼最小二乘法，``\"dls\"``）：:math:`A^{-} = A^T (AA^T + "
"\\lambda^2 \\mathbb{I})^{-1}` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:307
msgid "Transpose pseudo-inverse (``\"trans\"``): :math:`A^{-} = A^T`."
msgstr "转置法（``\"trans\"``）：:math:`A^{-} = A^T` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:308
msgid ""
"Adaptive singular-value decomposition (SVD) pseudo-inverse (``\"svd\"``) "
"from :cite:t:`buss2004ik`."
msgstr "自适应奇异值分解（SVD）伪逆（``\"svd\"``），见 :cite:t:`buss2004ik` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:309
msgid ""
"Manipulability-aware damped least-squares (``\"adaptive_dls\"``): the "
"damping :math:`\\lambda` increases as the Jacobian approaches a singularity."
msgstr "考虑可操作度的阻尼最小二乘法（``\"adaptive_dls\"``）：雅可比矩阵接近奇异状态时，增大阻尼 :math:`\\lambda` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:312
msgid ""
"These implementations are available through the "
":class:`DifferentialIKController` class. See :doc:`../how-to/run_diff_ik` "
"for a runnable example."
msgstr ""
"这些实现通过 :class:`DifferentialIKController` 提供。可运行示例见 :doc:`../how-"
"to/run_diff_ik` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:316
msgid "Impedance controller"
msgstr "阻抗控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:318
msgid ""
"It uses task-space pose error and Jacobian to compute joint torques through "
"mass-spring-damper system with a) fixed stiffness, b) variable stiffness "
"(stiffness control), and c) variable stiffness and damping (impedance "
"control)."
msgstr ""
"它利用任务空间位姿误差和雅可比矩阵，通过质量–弹簧–阻尼系统计算关节力矩，支持 a) 固定刚度、b) 可变刚度（刚度控制），以及 c) "
"可变刚度和阻尼（阻抗控制）。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:323
msgid "Operational-space controller"
msgstr "操作空间控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:325
msgid ""
"Similar to task-space impedance control but uses the Equation of Motion "
"(EoM) for computing the task-space force. See :doc:`../how-to/run_osc` for a"
" runnable example."
msgstr "与任务空间阻抗控制类似，但使用运动方程（EoM）计算任务空间力。可运行示例见 :doc:`../how-to/run_osc` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:330
msgid "Closed-loop proportional force controller"
msgstr "闭环比例力控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:332
msgid ""
"It uses a proportional term to track the desired wrench command with respect"
" to current wrench at the end-effector."
msgstr "它根据末端执行器当前力旋量与目标力旋量的误差，通过比例项跟踪目标力/力矩指令。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:337
msgid "Hybrid force-motion controller"
msgstr "混合力-运动控制器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:339
msgid ""
"It combines closed-loop force control and operational-space motion control "
"to compute the desired wrench at the end-effector. It uses selection "
"matrices that define the unconstrained and constrained task directions."
msgstr "它结合闭环力控制和操作空间运动控制，计算末端执行器的目标力旋量，并用选择矩阵指定任务中不受约束和受约束的方向。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:348
msgid "Practical API examples"
msgstr "API 使用示例"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:351
msgid "Joint targets"
msgstr "关节目标"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:353
msgid ""
"These alternative command examples assume an initialized ``robot`` and "
"resolved ``arm_joint_ids``. Each target has shape ``(num_envs, "
"len(arm_joint_ids))``. Set position or velocity feedback gains in the "
"actuator configuration; for direct effort control, set actuator stiffness "
"and damping to zero. See :ref:`actuators-runtime-api` for the command API "
"and :doc:`actuators` for gains."
msgstr ""
"下面分别展示不同类型的指令，假定 ``robot`` 已初始化，且 ``arm_joint_ids`` 已解析。每个目标张量的形状均为 "
"``(num_envs, "
"len(arm_joint_ids))``。位置或速度反馈增益在执行器配置中设置；直接控制力/力矩时，应将执行器刚度和阻尼设为零。指令 API 见 "
":ref:`actuators-runtime-api` ，增益配置见 :doc:`actuators` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:0
msgid "Position"
msgstr "位置"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:0
msgid "Velocity"
msgstr "速度"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:0
msgid "Effort"
msgstr "力/力矩"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:387
msgid ""
"These calls stage and submit commands. Advance physics and update the scene "
"on each cycle as shown in :ref:`controller-control-loop`."
msgstr ""
"这些调用先写入待发送指令，再提交给仿真。每个周期还需要推进物理仿真并更新场景，见 :ref:`controller-control-loop` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:391
msgid "Task-space goals"
msgstr "任务空间目标"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:393
msgid ""
"The :doc:`IK walkthrough <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` resets the robot and "
"changes the goal every 150 steps. On intermediate steps, it reads fresh "
"state and computes joint position targets; every step applies the targets "
"and advances the simulation:"
msgstr ""
":doc:`IK 教程 <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` 每隔 150 "
"步重置机器人并更换目标。其余步读取最新状态并计算关节位置目标；每一步都会应用目标并推进仿真："

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:397
msgid "scripts/tutorials/05_controllers/run_diff_ik.py"
msgstr "scripts/tutorials/05_controllers/run_diff_ik.py"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:404
msgid ""
"Relative commands also need the measured pose in "
":meth:`DifferentialIKController.set_command` to resolve the delta at command"
" time."
msgstr ""
"使用相对指令时，:meth:`DifferentialIKController.set_command` "
"还需要接收测得的位姿，以便在设置指令时解析相对增量。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:407
msgid ""
"An :class:`OperationalSpaceController` instance ``osc`` similarly stores its"
" motion/force goal with :meth:`OperationalSpaceController.set_command`, but "
":meth:`OperationalSpaceController.compute` returns efforts to stage with "
"``set_effort_index``. Its required state depends on the configured features."
" Use the :doc:`IK walkthrough <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` and :doc:`OSC "
"walkthrough <../how-to/run_osc>` for controller construction, state "
"extraction, and complete repeated loops."
msgstr ""
":class:`OperationalSpaceController` 实例 ``osc`` 同样通过 "
":meth:`OperationalSpaceController.set_command` 保存运动/力目标，但 "
":meth:`OperationalSpaceController.compute` 返回的是力/力矩，需要用 ``set_effort_index``"
" 写入。所需状态取决于启用的功能。控制器创建、状态提取和完整循环见 :doc:`IK 教程 <../how-to/run_diff_ik>` 与 "
":doc:`OSC 教程 <../how-to/run_osc>` 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:417
msgid "Reactive planners"
msgstr "反应式规划器"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:419
msgid ""
"Task-space controllers usually leave joint limits and collision avoidance to"
" a higher-level planner, such as RRT. Reactive planners can instead include "
"these constraints in the optimization that computes motion and control."
msgstr "任务空间控制器通常由 RRT 等上层规划器处理关节限位和避碰。反应式规划器则可将这些约束直接纳入运动与控制的优化计算。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:423
msgid "Examples of reactive planners include:"
msgstr "反应式规划器的示例包括："

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:425
msgid ""
"**RMPFlow (lula):** An acceleration-based policy that composes various "
"Reimannian Motion Policies (RMPs) to solve a hierarchy of tasks "
":cite:p:`cheng2021rmpflow`. It is capable of performing dynamic collision "
"avoidance while navigating the end-effector to a target."
msgstr ""
"**RMPFlow (lula):** 一种基于加速度的策略，通过组合各种黎曼运动策略（RMPs）来解决任务层次结构 "
":cite:p:`cheng2021rmpflow` 。它能够在将末端执行器导航到目标的同时执行动态避碰。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:429
msgid ""
"**MPC (OCS2):** A receding horizon control policy based on sequential "
"linear-quadratic (SLQ) programming. It formulates various constraints into a"
" single optimization problem via soft-penalties and uses automatic "
"differentiation to compute derivatives of the system dynamics, constraints "
"and costs. The MPC formulation for end-effector trajectory tracking in "
"fixed-arm and mobile manipulators described in "
":cite:p:`mittal2021articulated` considers a kinematic system model with "
"joint limits and self-collision avoidance. See the `OCS2 documentation "
"<https://leggedrobotics.github.io/ocs2/>`_ for the external toolbox and "
"examples."
msgstr ""
"**MPC（OCS2）：** "
"基于序贯线性二次（SLQ）规划的滚动时域控制策略。它通过软惩罚将各类约束纳入同一优化问题，并使用自动微分计算系统动力学、约束和代价的导数。 "
":cite:p:`mittal2021articulated` 中用于固定机械臂和移动操作机器人末端轨迹跟踪的 MPC "
"采用运动学系统模型，考虑关节限位和自碰撞规避。外部工具包和示例见 `OCS2 文档 "
"<https://leggedrobotics.github.io/ocs2/>`_ 。"

#: source/concepts/motion_generators.rst:439
msgid ""
":class:`RmpFlowController` wraps the CPU-based Lula bindings, so its "
"computation can limit throughput in large batches. It also needs the Lula "
"library and robot description files; these dependencies are separate from "
"the selected physics backend."
msgstr ""
":class:`RmpFlowController` 包装基于 CPU 的 Lula 绑定，因此大批量计算时可能限制吞吐量。它还需要 Lula "
"库和机器人描述文件；这些依赖与所选物理后端相互独立。"
